Package: mpaqt
Title: Multi-Platform Accurate Quantification of Transcripts
Version: 2.4.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ali", "Saberi", , "saberiato@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Michael", "Apostolides", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jichen", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Hamed S.", "Najafabadi", role = c("aut", "fnd"))
    )
Description: MPAQT is a generative framework that integrates short- and long-read
    RNA-seq to overcome each platform's limitations by combining positional-bias
    modeling with prior integration to enable state-of-the-art isoform-resolved
    transcript quantification.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
